OL,3,AElon Musk says record spending on US
OL,4,Amidterms was 'pretty foolish'
OL,5,
OL,6,FElon Musk said on Wednesday that he
OL,7,Ffelt "pretty foolish" about the record
OL,8,Fsum he spent on the US midterm
OL,9,Felections, following sweeping
OL,10,FRepublican defeats.
OL,12,FThe Tesla and SpaceX CEO was the
OL,13,Fcampaign's top individual donor, giving
OL,14,F$446m (#339m) to support President
OL,15,FDonald Trump's party, particularly in
OL,16,FTexas where many of Musk's firms are
OL,17,Fbased.
OL,19,FMusk, who had backed Trump's second
OL,20,FWhite House bid, also said he was "not
OL,21,FMaga" - the Make America Great Again
OL,22,Fmovement associated with the president.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
