OL,5,
OL,6,FDemocrats won control of the Senate and
OL,7,FHouse, while Texas, Ohio and other
OL,8,Fstates swung away from Trump, who has
OL,9,Ffaced pressure over the impact his
OL,10,Fpolicies have had on the cost of
OL,11,Fliving.
